  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate Resilience and Sustainable Development in the Cooperative Agricultural Sector of Rio Grande do Sul</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the MD visit to Brazil in July 2025 it was decided to explore opportunities for technical cooperation project development. The preparatory assistant funds will allow to develop for the cooperative agricultural sector in the region of Rio Grande do Sul a project concept to cover the thematic priorities of: # Improving the resilience of the agricultural value chains through improved soil management # a top priority following the extreme weather events of 2024; # Piloting opportunities for durable carbon removals and carbon credit generation in agricultural value chains, # opening new pathways for green financing; # Regenerative bioeconomy technologies, including opportunities for recycling of agricultural byproducts, nutrients and waste materials# serving as fundamental pillars for innovation and value creation across all regional supply chains.</narrative>
  </description>
